[h1]房车生活 3.8.6[/h1][list][*]支持 B42.20 单人、多人和专用服务器。[*]原版 SUV / PickUpVan 增加 1 个生活位；Van 增加 3 个；StepVan 增加 5 个及 1 个净水箱位。保留原有座位；受支持的客运 Van 不增加车内生活位。[*]KI5 Campers：Scamp 13 为 2 个生活位；Scamp 16、Bambi 16、Shasta Airflyte、Shasta Astrodome 各 3 个；Flying Cloud 22 为 4 个。保留原有座位、床位、储物、进入方式和电瓶，每款增加两个独立水箱位。[*]生活位支持床垫、行军床、睡袋、橱柜、直柜台、冰箱、微波炉、电视和饮水机水桶。已安装的非床铺设备在座位图中显示为白块；Van / StepVan 另有武器柜位。[*]水箱使用原版二级油箱部件，容量及耐久影响沿用原版；进水净化消耗车载电量。支持原版饮水、装水和洗涤菜单，排空后才能拆卸水箱。[*]受支持的原版车型可制作行李架、车窗护甲、防撞杠及底盘改良，材料按车型分档。行李架基础容量：StepVan 400、Van / VanSeats 300、SUV / PickUpVan 250。[*]车顶可挂载发电机、汽油罐、瓦斯罐、储物箱、帐篷、备胎和四盏射灯；射灯随原车大灯开关并使用主电瓶。站在装有瓦斯罐的车辆旁可补充随身喷灯。[*]冰箱、微波炉、电视和净水分别设置耗电；可通过沙盒选项控制新增安装，已安装设备保留。[/list][h1]启用方式[/h1][list][*]原版车辆：启用 VehicleLivingSlots。[*]KI5 房车：另启用 VehicleLivingSlotsKI5Campers，并安装 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3670064951]KI5 Campers![/url] 和 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3171167894]that DAMN Library[/url]。新 Shasta 车型需要 Campers! v0.940b 或更新版本。[*]原房车作者：KI5。此适配不打包原模组资产。[/list][h1]车辆快捷菜单与装拆[/h1][list][*]车辆发电机、汽油罐、瓦斯罐和水箱快捷菜单有四个独立沙盒开关，默认全部开启。只有安装对应设备的车辆才显示相关菜单。[*]车载发电机复用原版信息、连接、断开、开关和添加燃料操作；只在停车时向附近建筑供电，车辆移动自动停机并断开。车内设备继续使用既有车载电瓶。[*]使用原版“收集燃料”菜单，从车顶油罐给随身容器加油，按实际取出量扣除车顶燃料。支持红色汽油罐和军用汽油桶；维修列表沿用原版物品名称，空罐显示空罐名称。[*]瓦斯喷枪补充燃料复用原版配方；水箱复用原版饮水、灌装和清洗操作。KI5 房车支持其瓦斯罐和 VLS 水箱，不新增车顶发电机或汽油罐位。[*]行李架上的全部挂载物安装、拆除均不需要工具，沿用原版技工 1 级建议值和成功率机制；行李架本体制作要求不变。[/list][hr][h1]房車生活 3.8.6[/h1][list][*]支援 B42.20 單人、多人和專用伺服器。[*]原版 SUV / PickUpVan 增加 1 個生活位；Van 增加 3 個；StepVan 增加 5 個及 1 個淨水箱位。保留原有座位；受支援的客運 Van 不增加車內生活位。[*]KI5 Campers：Scamp 13 為 2 個生活位；Scamp 16、Bambi 16、Shasta Airflyte、Shasta Astrodome 各 3 個；Flying Cloud 22 為 4 個。保留原有座位、床位、儲物、進入方式和電瓶，每款增加兩個獨立水箱位。[*]生活位支援床墊、行軍床、睡袋、櫥櫃、直櫃台、冰箱、微波爐、電視和飲水機水桶。已安裝的非床鋪設備在座位圖中顯示為白塊；Van / StepVan 另有武器櫃位。[*]水箱使用原版二級油箱部件，容量及耐久影響沿用原版；進水淨化消耗車載電量。支援原版飲水、裝水和洗滌選單，排空後才能拆卸水箱。[*]受支援的原版車型可製作行李架、車窗護甲、防撞桿及底盤改良，材料按車型分級。行李架基礎容量：StepVan 400、Van / VanSeats 300、SUV / PickUpVan 250。[*]車頂可掛載發電機、汽油罐、瓦斯罐、儲物箱、帳篷、備胎和四盞射燈；射燈隨原車大燈開關並使用主電瓶。站在裝有瓦斯罐的車輛旁可補充隨身噴燈。[*]冰箱、微波爐、電視和淨水分別設定耗電；可透過沙盒選項控制新增安裝，已安裝設備保留。[/list][h1]啟用方式[/h1][list][*]原版車輛：啟用 VehicleLivingSlots。[*]KI5 房車：另啟用 VehicleLivingSlotsKI5Campers，並安裝 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3670064951]KI5 Campers![/url] 和 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3171167894]that DAMN Library[/url]。新 Shasta 車型需要 Campers! v0.940b 或更新版本。[*]原房車作者：KI5。此適配不打包原模組資產。[/list][h1]車輛快捷選單與裝拆[/h1][list][*]車輛發電機、汽油罐、瓦斯罐和水箱快捷選單有四個獨立沙盒開關，預設全部開啟。只有安裝對應設備的車輛才顯示相關選單。[*]車載發電機複用原版資訊、連接、斷開、開關和添加燃料操作；只在停車時向附近建築供電，車輛移動自動停機並斷開。車內設備繼續使用既有車載電瓶。[*]使用原版「收集燃料」選單，從車頂油罐給隨身容器加油，按實際取出量扣除車頂燃料。支援紅色汽油罐和軍用汽油桶；維修列表沿用原版物品名稱，空罐顯示空罐名稱。[*]瓦斯噴槍補充燃料複用原版配方；水箱複用原版飲水、灌裝和清洗操作。KI5 房車支援其瓦斯罐和 VLS 水箱，不新增車頂發電機或汽油罐位。[*]行李架上的全部掛載物安裝、拆除均不需要工具，沿用原版技工 1 級建議值和成功率機制；行李架本體製作要求不變。[/list][hr][h1]Mobile Living 3.8.6[/h1][list][*]B42.20: singleplayer, multiplayer and dedicated servers.[*]Vanilla SUV / PickUpVan: 1 living slot; Van: 3; StepVan: 5 plus 1 clean-water tank position. Original seats remain. Supported passenger Vans receive no interior living slots.[*]KI5 Campers: Scamp 13 has 2 living slots; Scamp 16, Bambi 16, Shasta Airflyte and Shasta Astrodome each have 3; Flying Cloud 22 has 4. Original seats, beds, storage, entry behavior and battery remain. Each camper gains two separate water-tank positions.[*]Living slots accept mattresses, cots, sleeping bags, cabinets, straight counters, fridges, microwaves, televisions and water-dispenser bottles. Installed non-bed equipment appears as white blocks in the seat diagram. Van / StepVan also have a weapon-locker position.[*]Water tanks use vanilla mechanic-type-2 fuel-tank items and retain native capacity and condition effects. Incoming-water purification consumes vehicle power. Native drinking, filling and washing menus are supported. Empty tanks before removal.[*]Supported vanilla models can fabricate roof racks, window armor, bumper guards and chassis improvements, with materials scaled by vehicle class. Base rack capacity: StepVan 400; Van / VanSeats 300; SUV / PickUpVan 250.[*]Roof positions accept generators, gas cans, propane tanks, storage chests, tents, spare tires and four spotlights. Spotlights share the original headlight switch and main battery. Stand beside a vehicle with an installed propane tank to refill a carried blowtorch.[*]Separate power settings cover refrigeration, microwaves, televisions and purification. Sandbox installation toggles preserve existing equipment.[/list][h1]Enable[/h1][list][*]Vanilla vehicles: enable VehicleLivingSlots.[*]KI5 campers: also enable VehicleLivingSlotsKI5Campers with [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3670064951]KI5 Campers![/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3171167894]that DAMN Library[/url]. New Shasta models require Campers! v0.940b or later.[*]Original camper author: KI5. This adapter does not bundle upstream mod assets.[/list][h1]Vehicle quick menus and attachments[/h1][list][*]Four independent sandbox options enable vehicle generator, petrol-can, propane-tank and water-tank quick menus. All default to enabled. A menu appears only when the corresponding equipment is installed.[*]Mounted generators use native information, connect, disconnect, on/off and add-fuel actions. They power nearby buildings only while parked; movement stops and disconnects them. Interior equipment continues using its existing vehicle battery.[*]Use the native Collect Fuel menu to fill carried containers from roof petrol cans. The roof source loses the actual amount collected. Red gas cans and military jerrycans are supported; the mechanics list uses native item names, including the empty state.[*]Blowtorch refilling uses the native recipe; water tanks use native drinking, filling and washing actions. KI5 campers support their propane tanks and VLS water tanks, without adding roof generator or petrol-can positions.[*]Every roof attachment can be installed and removed without tools, retaining the native Mechanics 1 recommendation and success calculation. Fabricating the roof rack itself keeps its existing requirements.[/list]
